  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Like many shifters raised in a close-knit community, you have always been strongly attuned to the presence of others. Willing allies that you are aware of within 60 feet that would otherwise be undetected by you are instead hidden from you. The flat check DC for you to target willing allies within 60 feet that are hidden from you is 5 instead of 11. </p>"
    },
